  "plan": "Wait a little longer for apt-get update. If it remains hung, I'll interrupt it and pursue an alternative fix — since the real curl binary is simply missing and replaced by a stub, I can install curl via a static binary or confirm network restriction. Either way, I'll diagnose the apt situation.",
  "commands": [
